[00:23.34]That snowflake once fell on my nose
[00:28.39]now flying backwards to last winter
[00:34.60]I realize that hellos are goodbyes
[00:39.71]The moment I softly let go of your hand
[00:46.15]Winds hum through the trembling branches
[00:51.12]A song for a soul bound to soar to
[00:54.67]The very edge of the starry ocean
[00:57.62]Even if we're meant to fall apart
[01:02.47]I will gaze at where you are for all time
[01:07.61]Bon voyage
[01:10.44]May your path be clear
[01:13.28]May you get to where dreams are all crystalline and sweet
[01:20.41]Please crack a little smile
[01:24.73]You won't be alone
[01:27.34]In this world you've chosen as your own
[01:31.92]Don't worry
[01:33.89]I'm well aware that all snowflakes melt in the end
[01:43.27]Which is sign of warmth and hope of spring
[01:47.96]So I'll dance flamboyantly into that good night
[02:04.74]Bon voyage
[02:07.60]May your path be clear
[02:10.39]May you get to where dreams are all crystalline and sweet
[02:17.60]Please crack a little smile
[02:21.89]You won't be alone
[02:24.50]In this world you've chosen as your own
[02:29.12]Timing is such a dazzling riddle
[02:34.70]Guess I'll spend my whole life unraveling it
[02:40.47]Though it might cost me everything I have
[02:46.11]I never regret it, wouldn't have it any other way cuz
[02:51.92]Those who trace starlight on their lonely roads
[02:57.51]Will find their destinations in the cosmos
[03:03.28]Meeting you in that swirling snowfall's
[03:08.84]the most beautiful thing ever happened to me
